card.statement:
Define a category ${\cA}$ $=$ ${\cA}_{U,{\Gamma}}$ with objects $\Ob{\cA}=$ $\Specm {\Gamma}$. The space of morphisms from $\sm$ to $\sn$ is defined as the completion of $U$, i.e.

\begin{equation*}
{\cA}(\sm,\sn) \ = \ _{\sn} \widetilde{U}_{\sm}\ \big(=
\varinjlim_{V\in F(U)} \varprojlim_{n,m} {} _{\sn^n}V_{ \sm^m}.\big)
\end{equation*}
